The objective of this project is to develop a Super Market Billing System using Python. The system allows users to enter multiple items, calculates the bill amount, 
applies discounts based on purchase value, and generates a final bill.


1. Take customer details.
2. Initialise subtotal and discount variables.
3. Use a loop to enter multiple items.
4. Calculate item amount.
5. Apply any discount using conditional statements.
6. Display item details.
7. Add amount and discount to totals.
8. Repeat until user enters 'n'.
9. Calculate final payable amount.
10. Display final bill.
